{"seq":21,"slug":"environmental-climate-economics","title":"环境与气候经济学","stage":"DONE","category":"economics-finance","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/economics-finance/environmental-climate-economics","rating":{"composite":3.66,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 环境与气候经济学\n\n空气、河流、稳定的气候，这些东西没有标价，却被所有人消费。正因为没有价格，市场会系统性地用错它们——工厂把烟囱当成免费的废物处理通道，渔船把公海当成取之不尽的鱼库。环境与气候经济学要回答的核心问题始终如一：当价格信号失灵时，社会该如何重新算清一笔账，让排放者、受益者与子孙后代的利益重新对齐。\n\n这个 hub 把这门学科拆成四条递进的主线，从抽象逻辑一路走到落地工具与转型现实。\n\n第一条线是基础逻辑。环境问题的经济学根源不是道德问题，而是结构问题：外部性让私人成本偏离社会成本，公共品的非排他性让人人搭便车，公地的开放准入让理性的个体合力毁掉共有资源。理解了这三个机制，才能看懂后面所有政策为什么这样设计。这一线同时提供了把环境损益翻译成货币的工具箱——支付意愿、成本效益分析——它们是后续所有量化讨论的计价单位。\n\n第二条线把镜头对准气候这个最棘手的外部性。气候变化的损害发生在几十上百年之后、跨越国界、充满不确定性，于是经济学家造出综合评估模型，试图算出今天每多排一吨二氧化碳给整个未来造成多少损失，也就是社会碳成本。这个数字高度依赖一个看似技术、实则伦理的参数——折现率。Stern 与 Nordhaus 之争表面是数学，实质是「我们欠未来多少」的价值判断。这一线还要权衡减缓与适应这两条应对路径如何分配资源。\n\n第三条线把这些数字变成可执行的政策。给碳定价是经济学家近乎一致的处方，但用碳税还是碳排放权交易，背后是 Weitzman「价格还是数量」的经典取舍。这一线追踪当下最活跃的制度前沿：欧盟碳市场、2026 年正式生效的碳边境调节机制、巴黎协定第六条下的国际碳信用，以及命令控制型规制与市场化工具的长期之争。\n\n第四条线走向转型现实。当政策信号确立，资本要重新配置——绿色金融与 ESG 投资把气候风险塞进资产定价；自然资本与生态系统服务试图把森林湿地的隐形价值搬上资产负债表；而能源转型一旦真正提速，谁来承担煤矿工人失业的代价，就成了「公正转型」必须直面的分配问题。\n\n四条线层层递进：先讲清为什么市场会失灵，再算出失灵的代价，然后设计纠正的工具，最后面对纠正过程中的资本流动与人的命运。读完整个 hub，你得到的不是一堆零散概念，而是一套用经济学应对环境与气候挑战的完整分析框架。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations-externalities","title":"基础：环境的经济学逻辑","docCount":3,"url":"/h/economics-finance/environmental-climate-economics/foundations-externalities","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"externalities-and-market-failure","title":"外部性与市场失灵（庇古·科斯）","url":"/h/economics-finance/environmental-climate-economics/foundations-externalities/externalities-and-market-failure"},{"seq":2,"slug":"public-goods-commons-property-rights","title":"公共品、公地悲剧与产权","url":"/h/economics-finance/environmental-climate-economics/foundations-externalities/public-goods-commons-property-rights"},{"seq":3,"slug":"environmental-valuation-cba","title":"环境估值与成本效益分析","url":"/h/economics-finance/environmental-climate-economics/foundations-externalities/environmental-valuation-cba"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"climate-economics-core","title":"气候经济学核心","docCount":3,"url":"/h/economics-finance/environmental-climate-economics/climate-economics-core","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"iam-and-social-cost-of-carbon","title":"气候变化经济学：综合评估模型与社会碳成本","url":"/h/economics-finance/environmental-climate-economics/climate-economics-core/iam-and-social-cost-of-carbon"},{"seq":2,"slug":"discounting-intergenerational-equity","title":"折现、代际公平与不确定性（Stern 对 Nordhaus）","url":"/h/economics-finance/environmental-climate-economics/climate-economics-core/discounting-intergenerational-equity"},{"seq":3,"slug":"mitigation-and-adaptation","title":"减缓与适应的经济学","url":"/h/economics-finance/environmental-climate-economics/climate-economics-core/mitigation-and-adaptation"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"policy-instruments-markets","title":"政策工具与碳市场","docCount":3,"url":"/h/economics-finance/environmental-climate-economics/policy-instruments-markets","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"carbon-pricing-tax-vs-ets","title":"碳定价：碳税与碳排放权交易（ETS）","url":"/h/economics-finance/environmental-climate-economics/policy-instruments-markets/carbon-pricing-tax-vs-ets"},{"seq":2,"slug":"global-carbon-markets-cbam","title":"全球碳市场、碳边境调节机制（CBAM）与巴黎协定第六条","url":"/h/economics-finance/environmental-climate-economics/policy-instruments-markets/global-carbon-markets-cbam"},{"seq":3,"slug":"command-control-vs-market","title":"命令控制型与市场化环境规制工具","url":"/h/economics-finance/environmental-climate-economics/policy-instruments-markets/command-control-vs-market"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"green-transition","title":"可持续发展与绿色转型","docCount":3,"url":"/h/economics-finance/environmental-climate-economics/green-transition","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"green-finance-and-esg","title":"绿色金融与 ESG 投资","url":"/h/economics-finance/environmental-climate-economics/green-transition/green-finance-and-esg"},{"seq":2,"slug":"natural-capital-ecosystem-services","title":"自然资本与生态系统服务","url":"/h/economics-finance/environmental-climate-economics/green-transition/natural-capital-ecosystem-services"},{"seq":3,"slug":"energy-transition-just-transition","title":"能源转型与公正转型经济学","url":"/h/economics-finance/environmental-climate-economics/green-transition/energy-transition-just-transition"}]}]}